        SIMULATE
* Simple M/M/1 Queue Model
* Customers arrive, wait in queue, get served, and leave
        GENERATE    10,3      Customers arrive every 10±3 time units
        QUEUE       LINE      Enter the queue
        SEIZE       SERVER    Seize the server
        DEPART      LINE      Leave the queue
        ADVANCE     8,2       Service time 8±2 time units
        RELEASE     SERVER    Release the server
        TERMINATE   1         Customer leaves system
        START       100       Simulate 100 customers
        END